  "vr_prompt": "I will give you the syllabus I have been studying (expected) and you will convert the PUBLISHED syllabus into the same format.\n\nFORMAT (one line per item, nothing else):\n# Exam name | prova: YYYY-MM-DD | horas: 12\n@ Subject name :: weight\n+ Topic name :: weight :: why this weight\n\nRULES:\n1. Use the SAME NAMES as my expected syllabus whenever the subject matter is the same, even if the published one words it differently. That is what preserves my progress.\n2. Only create a new name when the subject really is new.\n3. The subject weight comes from the number of questions in the exam.\n4. STRIP the syllabus numbering (\"1.1\", \"2.3\") from topic names.\n5. Do not group or summarise: a lost topic is worse than a long list.\n6. No \"::\" inside the text — only as a separator.\n\nMY EXPECTED SYLLABUS (use these names):\n{antes}\n\nPUBLISHED SYLLABUS:\n[paste the published syllabus here]",
