  "cm_gravados": "{n} cards saved across {t} topics. {r} were already there and were not duplicated.",
  "cm_prompt": "Below are study-card questions and the topic list of a syllabus. Say which topic each card belongs to.\n\nGOLDEN RULE: only name a topic if the card is clearly about it. When unsure, name ONLY the subject area — the card goes to its \"{geral}\" bucket, which is an honest place. Inventing a topic buries the card under a subject it is not about, and it stops showing up in the right review.\n\nUse the names from the list EXACTLY. Do not create new topics.\n\nFORMAT — one line per card, nothing else:\n~ <card number> :: <subject> > <topic>\nor, when you only know the subject:\n~ <card number> :: <subject>\n\nCards belonging to no subject on this list: return no line for them.\n\nCARDS\n{cartoes}\n\nTOPICS OF \"{edital}\"\n{topicos}",
