  "vk_prompt": "Below are subjects I have ALREADY STUDIED (in other exams) and the PENDING topics of a syllabus. Tell me which ones cover the same content.\n\nGOLDEN RULE: when in doubt, do NOT relate them. Telling me I studied something I did not makes me SKIP a subject on exam day. Failing to relate them only costs me repeating a study session. The two mistakes are not the same size.\n\nRELATE when it is the same subject, even under another name.\n\nDO NOT RELATE:\n  · a different slice of the same field\n  · a rule from a different jurisdiction\n  · similar name, different subject\n\nConfidence: ALTA (same content) or MEDIA (equivalent with a caveat). Return nothing of low confidence. Write nothing outside the format.\n\nFORMAT — one line per pair:\n~ <studied subject> :: <syllabus topic> :: ALTA :: why\n\nALREADY STUDIED\n{estudei}\n\nPENDING IN \"{edital}\"\n{pendentes}",
