  "nd_prompt": "Fill in ONE subject of an exam syllabus in the format below.\n\nFORMAT — exactly these lines:\nDISCIPLINA: <subject name>\nPESO: <1 to 5>\nTÓPICOS:\n<topic> :: <1 to 5> :: <why it shows up>\n\nRULES\n1. Subject weight: 5 = worth the most; 1 = the least. Differentiate them.\n2. Topic weight: 5 = shows up in almost every exam by this board; 1 = rare.\n3. Third field short and checkable. Do not invent statistics.\n4. One topic per line. No numbering, no markdown.\n5. Nothing before DISCIPLINA: or after the last topic.\n\nEXAM: {concurso}\nBOARD: {banca}\nSUBJECT: {disc}\n\nPaste the syllabus excerpt below this line:",
