  "dica_prompt": "Rewrite the study hint below more clearly.\nIt is MY note. Improving it means making it easier to understand and remember — NOT summarising.\n\nCONTENT\n1. Do not cut information. Everything the hint states must remain.\n2. Reorganise what is confusing or repeated — but nothing said may disappear.\n3. Do not add information that is not in the hint or the excerpt.\n\nFORM — the app understands ONLY these marks:\n4. Bold like this: **expression**. Use it on the two or three key expressions, never whole sentences.\n5. Italics like this: _expression_.\n6. To separate ideas use LINE BREAKS — one idea per line, as many lines as needed.\n7. Do NOT use # headings, - or * lists, tables or emoji: they show up as raw text.\n\nANSWER\n8. Answer only with the rewritten hint. No intro, no sign-off, no notes about what changed.\n9. The answer should be about the same length as the original, or longer. If it is much shorter, you summarised — redo it.\n\nEXCERPT IT REFERS TO:\n{trecho}\n\nCURRENT HINT:\n{texto}",
