  "cm_mel_prompt": "FIX a malformed memorisation card. Same content, same point, only clean.\n\nPROBLEMS FOUND:\n{defeitos}\n\nRULES\n1. One card, one idea. If it joins two or three, return two or three cards.\n2. No formatting rules or instructions about HOW to make cards.\n3. No numbering, markdown or emoji.\n4. The question must be answerable without seeing the back.\n5. For cloze use {{c1::term}} with a DIFFERENT number per blank.\n6. Do not invent content.\n\nFORMAT — one line per card:\nquestion :: answer :: tags\n\nUse EXACTLY these tags: {etiquetas}\n\nSUBJECT: {disciplina}\nTOPIC: {topico}\n\nCARD TO FIX:\n{atual}",
