  "qm_prompt": "FIX a malformed exam question. Return the SAME question, on the SAME point, only clean.\n\nPROBLEMS FOUND:\n{defeitos}\n\nRULES\n1. The STATEMENT must not contain the answer or its justification. Everything explanatory goes to COMENTARIO.\n2. No chatter with the user.\n3. No quiz headers, numbering or separators.\n4. No markdown.\n5. No emoji.\n6. ONE question only.\n7. Keep the original TYPE ({tipo}).\n8. Keep the answer legally correct; if it was wrong, fix it and explain in COMENTARIO.\n9. A True/False statement is ONE assertion to judge.\n10. Do not invent case law, article numbers or statistics.\n\nANSWER FORMAT — exactly this:\n[QUESTAO]\nTIPO: {tipo}\nBANCA: {banca}\nENUNCIADO: (clean statement)\n{opcoes_rot}GABARITO: (C or E, or the letter)\nCOMENTARIO: (why)\n[/QUESTAO]\n\nSUBJECT: {disciplina}\nTOPIC: {topico}\n\nQUESTION TO FIX:\n{atual}",
